{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-90",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Complete eight-row, eight-column chessboard for comparing rows and individual cells with the whole board. No requested fraction or selected subset is marked.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/4m/figures/fig-90.png",
      "sha256": "8d1c719d4ca6c603893dbc32274e850f22f50820782700feabc4f5a7d85ad901"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "math4-c1-s3-n22",
        "text": "除了符号$<$和$>$外，还采用符号$\\le$（小于或等于）和$\\ge$（大于或等于）。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math4-c1-s3-n22",
        "text": "不等式$x<6$的自然数解的集合由1，2，3，4，5组成。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math4-c1-s3-n22",
        "text": "如果在上列不等式中把符号$<$换成$\\le$，就得到另一个不等式：\n$x\\le6$。\n它的自然数解的集合由1，2，3，4，5，6组成。\n\n6是不等式$x\\le6$的解，但是它不是不等式$x<6$的解。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math4-c1-s3-n22",
        "exercise": "325",
        "text": "325. 图90是一个棋盘。下列部分各占棋盘的几分之几？\na) 一排方格；\nb) 三排方格；\nc) 一个方格；\nd) 七个方格。"
      }
    ],
